  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase awareness and respect for online freedom of expression by carrying out activities that educate, inform, influence, and support the implementation of policies, laws, and practices on the subject matter. The project is expected to significantly change the overall outlook toward digital engagement in Nigeria.</narrative>
